{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53145","headline":"灵岩述旧 · 欧阳詹","name":"灵岩述旧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不到灵岩又二年，重来风景尚依然。\n层峦迥出青霄外，倦鸟归飞夕照边。\n坐爱云林泉石好，行寻煖谷野桥连。\n同游不觉天将晚，暂借僧房一榻眠。\n（见嘉靖《略阳县志》卷六、光绪三十年重刊谭瑀《略阳县志》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}